  "body": "8/933 East Coast Road | 2 Bedrooms | 2 Bathrooms | Two Levels\r\n\r\nWhy settle for ordinary when you can have sunshine, sea views and space to enjoy?\r\n\r\nDiscover a home that brings together modern comfort, coastal appeal and everyday convenience. Positioned on a desirable corner, this brand-new two-level home enjoys abundant natural sunlight, lovely sea views and generous outdoor living – a combination that's increasingly hard to find.\r\n\r\nWHAT MAKES THIS HOME SPECIAL?\r\n• SUNNY CORNER POSITION – Enjoy extra natural light and a bright, welcoming atmosphere throughout the day.\r\n• SEA VIEWS – Bring a little coastal magic into your everyday living.\r\n• GENEROUS OUTDOOR SPACE – Room to entertain, relax, enjoy your morning coffee or simply soak up the sunshine.\r\n• MODERN TWO-LEVEL LIVING – Two comfortable bedrooms and two bathrooms, offering flexibility and practicality.\r\n• 10-YEAR STANFORD WARRANTY – Enjoy added peace of mind with your brand-new home.\r\n• CONVENIENCE AT YOUR DOORSTEP – With a bus stop right outside, commuting and getting around is wonderfully easy.\r\n\r\nA SMART MOVE FOR YOUR NEXT CHAPTER IS HERE :\r\n\r\nFirst-home buyers, here's your opportunity to secure a brand-new home with lifestyle appeal.\r\n\r\nDownsizers, why give up the sunshine, views and outdoor space you love? Enjoy a more manageable home without compromising on the things that matter.\r\n\r\nRetirees, embrace comfortable modern living with public transport right at your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhether it's your first home or your next chapter, this property offers a wonderful balance of comfort, convenience and coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination deserve a closer look. Contact us today to arrange your private viewing. You may have just found the one!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
